{"meta":{"id":"directory-rule","category":"aide/rules","title":"디렉토리 규칙","subtitle":"(번호·분리·LINK.md)","summary":"번호 규칙, case1/case2, 언어 분리, LINK.md","tags":["aide","규칙","디렉토리"],"color":"slate","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-linux-files","updatedAt":"2026-09-05"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-violet-100 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-60 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n<div class=\"absolute -bottom-16 -left-16 w-48 h-48 bg-slate-100 rounded-full blur-2xl opacity-80 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-slate-200\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\n    <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 border border-slate-300 tracking-wider\">\n      <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-slate-600\"></span>\n      규칙\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide uppercase text-stone-400 font-serif\">aide Meta Rules</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">\n    디렉토리 규칙 <span class=\"text-base sm:text-lg font-normal text-slate-600 font-serif\">(번호·분리·LINK.md)</span>\n  </h1>\n\n  <div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-slate-100/80 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-3\">\n    <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-slate-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\">\n      <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n    </svg>\n    <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\">\n      <strong class=\"text-stone-900\">문서 범위:</strong> 디렉토리/파일을 어떻게 나누고 이름 붙일지에 대한 규칙\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"py-5 border-b border-stone-100\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-slate-600\"></div>\n    <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide uppercase\">핵심 포인트</h2>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\">\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-slate-600\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">번호 규칙:</strong> 디렉토리(폴더)만 1-, 2-, 3- 번호를 매기고, 순수 콘텐츠 파일(리프)은 이름 그대로 씀</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-slate-600\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">case1/case2:</strong> 같은 언어·같은 기능인데 구현 형태가 다르면 case로 분리 (예: 로그인 연동의 백엔드/프론트 조합 차이)</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-slate-600\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">언어가 다르면 언어로 분리:</strong> case가 아니라 언어별로 나눔 (예: python.py / java.java를 같은 폴더에 나란히)</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"py-5\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-slate-600\"></div>\n      <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide uppercase\">LINK.md — 외부 참조 추적</h2>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xs bg-white p-4\">\n    <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mb-2\">\n      <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">1-rules</code>, <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">2-tutorials</code>, <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">3-modules</code>, <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">4-error</code>, <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">5-project</code> 최상단에 LINK.md를 두고, 그 카테고리 밖에서 하위 파일을 참조하는 곳을 기록한다.\n    </p>\n    <pre class=\"text-[11px] bg-stone-50 border border-stone-200 rounded-lg p-3 overflow-x-auto text-stone-700 font-mono\"># LINK.md\n\n## 연결 목록\n- &lt;이 카테고리 안의 파일 경로&gt; &lt;- &lt;참조하는 외부 파일 경로&gt;</pre>\n    <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mt-2\">\n      <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">규칙:</strong> 연결된 파일(하위 파일 또는 참조하는 외부 파일)을 수정할 때는 LINK.md를 먼저 확인해서 반대편도 같이 확인·수정한다.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mt-2 bg-stone-50 border border-stone-200/80 rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-4.5\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2.5\">\n    <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-slate-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n      <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"></path>\n    </svg>\n    <h3 class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-900\">이 위키에 실제로 적용된 사례</h3>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"space-y-2 text-stone-600 pl-1\">\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-slate-600\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">myWiki의 <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">4-data/structure/it/linux/linux-types/ubuntu</code>, <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">rocky-linux</code>가 바로 \"같은 개념, 배포판(=언어에 준하는 축)이 다르면 폴더로 분리\" 사례입니다.</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-slate-600\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">이 aide 카테고리 자체도 aide/의 번호 접두(1-rules, 2-tutorials, 3-modules)를 폴더 title에 그대로 남겨 원본 구조를 추적할 수 있게 했습니다.</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mt-5 pt-3 border-t border-stone-100 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-stone-400\">\n  <span>aide Meta Rules</span>\n  <span>디렉토리 규칙</span>\n</div>\n","path":"aide/rules/directory-rule","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"aide","title":"aide","path":"aide"},{"id":"rules","title":"규칙","path":"